T Zigzag compliant spring
# A serpentine of bending rods. Every segment adds compliance in series, so more segments is softer,
# and one longer rod in the chain softens it far more than another short one would.
! anchored at the bottom, free at the top
C Z0 W8 0,0,0.5 x y
C Z1 W8 0,2,2.5 x y
C Z2 W8 0,1,3.5 x y
C Z3 W8 0,3,5.5 x y
R Z0 Z1 yellow beam
R Z1 Z2 white beam
R Z2 Z3 yellow beam
F Z3 0,-3,0 push
